# Demo: querying openssl changelog via gemini-cli + rpm-mcp
# Prerequisites: PostgreSQL running, rpm-mcp database populated

Output docs/vhs/demo_changelog.gif
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Monokai"

Type "gemini -p 'what are the recent security-related changelog entries for openssl?' --allowed-mcp-server-names=rpm-mcp"
Enter
Sleep 15s
